%% OAN Message row (connector outbox) as shown in the Desk
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Queued: queue_sms()
  Queued --> Queued: uncertain outcome<br/>retry, same key
  Queued --> Submitted: OAN accepted (202/200)
  Queued --> Failed: rejected / conflict /<br/>expired before submission
  Submitted --> Submitted: poll: accepted / sending / sent
  Submitted --> Done: poll: delivered / failed<br/>(Telegram: sent)
  Submitted --> Attention: poll: unknown or<br/>receipt window ended
  Failed --> Attention
  state "Polling complete" as Done
  state "Needs Attention (operator)" as Attention
